From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: gaokun3: vreg_l4b常开

这份设备树里只有usb_1_qmpphy（vdda-pll）用到vreg_l4b（0.912V），主线里
usb_1_hsphy也持有它。UCSI切换插头方向或模式时，combo PHY强制重新初始化，
l4b就会断电。断电后port1的USB2一侧可能冻住：端口不再看到插拔，设备拔掉后
xHCI还显示已连接，再插也枚举不了，直到重启。USB3走QMP重新训练，不受影响，
所以U盘这类设备看不出这个问题。

不是每次断电都出事，现象是偶发的。有些开机时EC在启动阶段就发USB事件，重配
发生在插设备之前，这次开机里USB2一开始就不能用。

这和port0的vreg_l9d（0086）是同一类问题，映射同样来自linux-gaokun的20445ba。
port1保持host角色时PHY一直持有这路电，常开不改变待机时的状态。

问题由Rivarise在#53报告，并定位到Type-C重配这条路径。
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts
@@ -440,6 +440,15 @@
 			regulator-min-microvolt = <912000>;
 			regulator-max-microvolt = <912000>;
 			regulator-initial-mode = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_HPM>;
+			/*
+			 * usb_1_qmpphy is its only consumer here, but port1's
+			 * USB2 side needs it too: mainline also has usb_1_hsphy
+			 * on this rail. Without this, every forced combo PHY
+			 * re-initialisation (orientation or mode switch) turns
+			 * it off, and USB2 on port1 can stop seeing any plug
+			 * or unplug until reboot.
+			 */
+			regulator-always-on;
 			// HACK: wrongly voting for LPM may block DP Alt
 			// regulator-allow-set-load;
 			// regulator-allowed-modes = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_LPM
